-- ---------------------------------------------------------------- 1. Exact dynamical descent
-- A macro-law g : O → O descends through observation o : S → O for dynamics T : S → S when
-- o (T s) = g (o s) for every state s.
Descends : {S O : Type} → (S → O) → (S → S) → (O → O) → Type
Descends {S} {O} o T g = (s : S) → g (o s) ≡ o (T s)
